---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Prose from "../components/Prose.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About Me" description="Abayomi Popoola">
  <div class="container">
    <article>
      <div class="mb-10 w-full gap-16 md:flex md:items-center">
        <div class="leading-9 text-pretty">
          <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold">Hello!</h2>
          <Prose>
            <div>
              <p>
                I’m Abayomi Popoola, an engineering leader and entrepreneur. I
                build products, design systems, and lead teams, with a focus on
                distributed systems, payments, and developer tooling.
              </p>

              <p>
                I’ve helped build dozens of products, mostly in small,
                fast-moving teams. Much of my work has been in payments, and the
                infrastructure behind them. More recently, I’ve been building
                developer tools and exploring local AI inference on Apple
                Silicon.
              </p>

              <p>
                I’ve led engineering organisations and stayed hands-on with
                architecture and code. I enjoy connecting technical decisions to
                business needs, whether that means shaping a platform, improving
                reliability, or getting a new product into people’s hands. See
                more on my{" "}
                <a
                  href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/abayomipopoola/"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noreferrer"
                >
                  LinkedIn
                </a>
                .
              </p>

              <ul>
                <li>
                  Building{" "}
                  <a
                    href="https://usemux.com/"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noreferrer"
                  >
                    Mux
                  </a>
                  , a cloud-based coding agent harness
                </li>
                <li>
                  Developing{" "}
                  <a
                    href="https://mlxchat.dev/"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noreferrer"
                  >
                    MLX Chat
                  </a>
                  , an app for running language models locally on Mac
                </li>
                <li>
                  Technical writing on{" "}
                  <a
                    href="https://medium.com/@abayomip"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noreferrer"
                  >
                    Medium
                  </a>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </Prose>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
